    "en": {
      "trackName": "Psychotechnical Test Drive",
      "description": "Train your reflexes while having fun with this psychotechnical test simulator. Improve your coordination and reaction times in an entertaining, challenging way.\n\nEver wondered how others perform on these tests? Now you can submit your score and compete to see who has the best coordination!\n\nPlus, it’s Apple Watch compatible: the Digital Crown wheel is perfect for simulating test control, taking your practice to the next level.\n\nThis test does not have official validity, but it can help you prepare for the real exam.",
